# 本机开发；Cookie/CSRF由独立会话注入，不保存凭据。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:4180/api/ops/v1

### 经办：原核销须POSTED/version4，金额由后端读取
POST {{base}}/prepayment-allocations/{{allocationId}}/reversals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{createKey}}
If-Match: "4"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"reason":"DEMO allocation error","reference":"DEMO investigation"}

### 读取撤销申请
GET {{base}}/allocation-reversals/{{reversalId}}

### 独立复核
POST {{base}}/allocation-reversals/{{reversalId}}/actions/review
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{reviewKey}}
If-Match: "1"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"approve":true,"reason":"DEMO review"}

### 独立审批
POST {{base}}/allocation-reversals/{{reversalId}}/actions/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{approveKey}}
If-Match: "2"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"approve":true,"reason":"DEMO approval"}

### 单独入账，仅恢复分配余额
POST {{base}}/allocation-reversals/{{reversalId}}/actions/post
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{postKey}}
If-Match: "3"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"reason":"DEMO reversal posting"}

### 刷新余额和原件
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payment-admission

GET {{base}}/prepayment-allocations/{{allocationId}}
